OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G1/4
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINIONCBBC in danger of death by a
OL,4,Cthousand cuts in absence of new funding
OL,5,Cmodel
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere is nothing funny about the BBC's
OL,8,Ffinancial situation.
OL,10,FBut the corporation's press office at
OL,11,Fleast seems to have a sense of humour.
OL,13,FThe decision to axe Blankety Blank is
OL,14,Fbeing presented as a financial move.
OL,16,FIt will be coming to an end along with
OL,17,FCelebrity Mastermind and Live at the
OL,18,FApollo.
OL,23,EPub: 29-Jul-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,142,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14102
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F141A1785328895
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G2/4
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINIONCBBC in danger of death by a
OL,4,Cthousand cuts in absence of new funding
OL,5,Cmodel
OL,6,
OL,7,FYou can just imagine the joke: "The
OL,8,Fpoor old BBC is broke. It's so skint
OL,9,Fit's even having to axe Blankety
OL,10,FBlank." Only there's no word to fill
OL,11,Fin.
OL,13,FThe decision to axe these programmes `
OL,14,For rather the decision to axe them but
OL,15,Fnot replace them ` will contribute to
OL,16,Fthe corporation's huge savings target.
OL,18,FBut the thing is, it's only going to
OL,19,Fget worse before it gets better.
OL,23,EPub: 29-Jul-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,142,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14103
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F141A1785328895
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G3/4
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINIONCBBC in danger of death by a
OL,4,Cthousand cuts in absence of new funding
OL,5,Cmodel
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe government needs to commit to a
OL,8,Fmethod of reforming or replacing the
OL,9,Flicence fee urgently.
OL,11,FThe BBC cannot die a death of a
OL,12,Fthousand cuts under a government that
OL,13,Fclaims to support public services and
OL,14,FBritish creativity.
OL,16,FAt this rate, jokes about bringing back
OL,17,Fthe test card risk being mistaken for
OL,18,Fkey strategic objectives.
OL,20,FNobody would claim the public should
OL,21,Fwrite the BBC a blank ` or blankety
OL,22,Fblank ` check.
OL,23,EPub: 29-Jul-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,142,140,200,120,0,100
