OL,3,GOPINIONCBBC in danger of death by a
OL,4,Cthousand cuts in absence of new funding
OL,5,Cmodel
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut if you care about the BBC and
OL,8,Fpublic service broadcasting, the
OL,9,Furgency of the situation is clear.
